silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_avro_substrate_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '02AvrosubstratelegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In the Music graph engine entry section 02_avro_substrate_leg, the music_typed_leg_4 arrow witnesses the Mittens microchip-id arrow witnessing identifier-by-leg, distinct from identifier-as-Mittens." .
